<view class="page-shell cat-page relax-page">
  <scroll-view class="cat-scroll has-tabbar" scroll-y>
    <view class="cat-body relax-body">
      <view class="relax-head" style="padding-top: {{nav.navigationBottom}}px;">
        <image class="relax-mark" src="{{assets.crescent}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        <text class="relax-title">放松</text>
      </view>
      <text class="cat-sub">先让身体安静下来，其他事可以晚一点再处理。</text>

      <view class="relax-list">
        <button
          class="relax-row"
          wx:for="{{entries}}"
          wx:key="id"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="openEntry"
          hover-class="is-pressed"
          aria-label="{{item.label}}"
        >
          <view class="relax-copy">
            <text class="relax-label">{{item.label}}</text>
            <text class="relax-detail">{{item.detail}}</text>
          </view>
          <image class="relax-go" src="/assets/agent/icons/chevron-right-muted.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        </button>
      </view>

      <text class="cat-note">这些入口都指向项目里已经实现的功能，声音、呼吸与记录数据都保存在本机。</text>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="dock-tabbar">
    <night-tabbar active="relax"></night-tabbar>
  </view>
</view>
